Assignment 28: Write an R Program to calculate Decimal into binary of a given number.
Solution:
# R program to convert decimal to binary
# Input decimal number
num <- 10
# Convert decimal to binary
binary <- ""
n <- num
while(n > 0) {
 remainder <- n %% 2
 binary <- paste(remainder, binary, sep = "")
 n <- n %/% 2
}
# Print result
cat("Decimal number:", num, "\n")
cat("Binary equivalent:", binary)



